{"reviews":[{"review_id":"548a1925-3343-452f-817c-f5b77f527fb4","review_text":"Turns on by itself, very annoying, no obvious way to stop it except to hit pause after it starts......or just delete the app"},{"review_id":"f12e8c11-d326-4d49-8226-3e9907a8c719","review_text":"Spotify has removed the best way to discover new music. 

Like many people, I organize my music in playlists by genre. Then I listen to dynamic radio stations based on those playlists. Now Spotify has removed this Playlist Radio feature for no apparent reason. 

Discover Weekly is nice, but is a mish-mash of genres over which you have no control. There are Daily Mixes, but these definitely do not refresh daily. And again, no control over the genres."}]}
